  "revision_rationale": "Ground-truth definition refined by the law designer: any movement whose physical postcondition includes an in-window write or delete inherently carries a temporal residual (the change occurs between the enter and exit frames, unaccounted by a static endpoint diff). Therefore every ATTACK variant now expects TEMPORAL_RACE in the unexplained residual set and T in the process components. CONTROL variants perform the SAME physical action under declared authority, which EXPLAINS the temporal residual, so their expected unexplained residual set stays empty (any PUB HOLD on a control remains an honest false-HOLD). This revision does NOT remove the RT05 CONTAINER_ESCAPE / RT08 RESPONSIBILITY_SWAP gold labels, so genuine detection gaps are preserved as FN.",
